---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Engineering Notes"
  description="Technical deep-dives into architecture decisions, incident recovery, and systems thinking."
>
  <section class="py-13">
    <nav class="mb-8">
      <a href="/" class="text-14 text-accent no-underline">← Back home</a>
    </nav>

    <h1 style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: var(--fs-40); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 24px;">Engineering Notes</h1>

    <p style="font-size: 18px; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 48px; max-width: 65ch;">Deep-dives into decisions, incidents, and lessons from building data platforms and backend infrastructure at scale.</p>

    <!-- Published Notes -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 24px;">Published</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6">
        <div class="p-5 bg-panel border border-rule rounded">
          <a href="/engineering-notes/debezium-50m-row-snapshot/" class="no-underline text-inherit">
            <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 8px;">The 50M-row Debezium snapshot incident</h3>
            <p class="text-14 text-ink-2">A snapshot operation consumed 60% CPU and nearly blocked a critical migration. How we recovered and what it taught about production risk vs architectural purity.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="padding-top: 8px;">
      <h2 class="font-code text-16 font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-[0.1em] mb-4">Incident record</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink-2); max-width: 65ch; margin-bottom: 16px;">Ten production problems covering diagnosis, architecture, customer judgment, correctness, resilience, and leadership under pressure.</p>
      <a href="/engineering-notes/incidents/" style="color: var(--accent); font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 14px;">Read all ten incident records →</a>
    </section>

  </section>
</Layout>
